```console
$ scherzo-cloud run inputs --help
View, download, or delete retained run inputs

Usage: scherzo-cloud run inputs [COMMAND]

Commands:
  show      Show the retained input inventory for a run
  download  Download and verify retained input members atomically
  delete    Make retained input content logically unavailable and schedule cleanup
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
